{% if public %}
<section class="blk" id="about"><header><h2>{{ L('方法', 'Method') }}</h2></header>
<div class="about">
  <div><h4>{{ L('数据纪律', 'Data discipline') }}</h4><p>{{ L('所有数字都来自程序抓取，存档为带来源和时间戳的快照。当天数据缺失就显示"暂缺"，绝不回退到旧数据。', 'Every number is fetched programmatically and archived as a snapshot with source and timestamp. Missing data shows as "N/A" — stale data is never substituted.') }}</p></div>
  <div><h4>{{ L('双源校验', 'Cross-checking') }}</h4><p>{{ L('指数、期货和异动个股都与 CNBC 行情比对，差异超过 ' ~ tol ~ '% 标红。LBMA 定价日期与交易日不一致时标"非当日"。', 'Indices, futures and flagged stocks are checked against CNBC quotes; gaps above ' ~ tol ~ '% are flagged red. LBMA fixes from another date are marked stale.') }}</p></div>
  <div><h4>{{ L('事实与观点分离', 'Facts vs views') }}</h4><p>{{ L('每条原因都标注"已证实 / 分析师 / 媒体报道 / AI 推断"并附编号来源；找不到来源时明确写"未检索到"，不做无来源概括。', 'Every reason is tagged Confirmed / Analyst / Media report / AI inference with numbered sources; when nothing is found it says so rather than generalising.') }}</p></div>
  <div><h4>{{ L('调度', 'Scheduling') }}</h4><p>{{ L('用交易所日历取每日实际收盘时刻（含提前收盘），再用 zoneinfo 处理英美夏令时错位，收盘后 20 分钟抓取。技术栈为 Python、yfinance、exchange_calendars 和 Jinja2。', 'Exchange calendars give each session\'s actual close (incl. early closes); zoneinfo handles the UK/US DST mismatch; data is pulled 20 min after the close. Stack: Python, yfinance, exchange_calendars, Jinja2.') }}</p></div>
</div>
